 61MN c  1999Ha05: 1-GeV proton-induced spallation of uranium UC{-2} target     
 61MN2c  at ISOLDE-CERN facility. The laser ionized Mn isotopes were extracted  
 61MN3c  from the ion source and mass separated. Using tape systems measured    
 61MN4c  |b-delayed neutron multiscaling, E|g and |g|g coincidence. |b-delayed  
 61MN5c  neutron collected by multiscaling measurements using Mainz 4|p He      
 61MN6c  neutron counter.                                                       
