 61MN cL J$spin from analysis of hyperfine structure spectrum in 2015Ba49, using
 61MN2cL collinear laser spectroscopy. Spin of 7/2 gave unrealistically large   
 61MN3cL and negative static quadrupole moment of -5.6 {I8}. Parity from        
 61MN4cL probable allowed |b feeding of (3/2-) g.s. in {+61}Fe from {+61}Mn     
 61MN5cL decay. Large-scale shell-model calculations, and systematics of ground 
 61MN6cL states of odd-A Mn nuclei suggest 5/2-.                                
 61MN cL MOMM1,MOME2$from collinear laser spectroscopy technique at ISOLDE-CERN 
 61MN2cL (2016Ba44) The moments were measured with reference to                 
 61MN3cL |m=+3.46871790 {I9} (1974Lu08) and  Q=+0.33 {I1} (1979De19) for        
