 61MN2cL of odd-A Mn nuclei. Probable allowed |b feeding of (3/2-) g.s. in      
 61MN3cL {+61}Fe from {+61}Mn decay supports this assignment, and also suggests 
 61MN4cL the same parity for the ground states of {+61}Mn and {+61}Fe           
